#. STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_TROPICAL.BURNT.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.KIRITZUKA_SPEECH_VARIANTS.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_TROPICAL.BURNT.1"
